<!-- G11a-2 fixture, written by hand for the parity harness of PPP (no source music): ties into and around a volta. Bar 2 ends on E5 tied forward; bar 3 (first ending) starts on the E5 it ties to (a tie that is led into, struck once); bar 4 (second ending) starts on an E5 tied-TO that nothing leads into - the first ending did not end on it, the tie from bar 2 does not reach it (a tie that leads nowhere: struck by the old player, asked by follow mode only with FOLLOW_TIE). The left hand ties a G2 from bar 1 into bar 2. Written order: 1 2 3 | 1 2 4 5. -->
